n.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Tarja Halonen</span><span class="tp">b. 1943</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/hamid-karzai"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/hamid-karzai.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Hamid Karzai</span><span class="tp">b. 1957</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/ilham-aliyev"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/ilham-aliyev.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Ilham Aliyev</span><span class="tp">b. 1961</span></span></a></li></ul></section>
<section class="day-ppl" aria-labelledby="day-died"><h2 class="ref-sec-title" id="day-died">Died on 24 December <span class="n">3</span></h2><ul class="enc-seealso"><li><a href="/encyclopedia/vasco-da-gama"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/vasco-da-gama.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Vasco da Gama</span><span class="tp">c. 1469–1524</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/karl-donitz"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/karl-donitz.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Karl Dönitz</span><span class="tp">1891–1980</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/joao-figueiredo"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/joao-figueiredo.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">João Figueiredo</span><span class="tp">1918–1999</span></span></a></li></ul></section>
